@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = paste_access_token_here
@csrfToken = paste_csrf_token_here

### Получить CSRF-токен и cookie перед входом или регистрацией
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

### Вход
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"login":"admin","password":"your-strong-password"}

### Список с поиском, сортировкой и пагинацией
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?fio=Иванов&sortBy=isu&sortDir=asc&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Получить студента
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/123456
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Создать студента (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"isu":123456,"fio":"Иванов Иван","group":"P1234","dormNumber":1,"roomNumber":101,"dateInDorm":"2024-09-01","isForeign":false,"notes":""}

### Полное обновление (ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/students/123456
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"isu":123456,"fio":"Иванов Иван","group":"P1234","dormNumber":1,"roomNumber":202,"dateInDorm":"2024-09-01","isForeign":false,"notes":""}

### Частичное обновление (ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/students/123456
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomNumber":203}

### Удаление (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/students/123456
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
